# label: alg:ch60-pipeline
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch60.tex:204
# caption: Link the complete static image in dependency order.

REQUIRE Lua map and ordered validated-profile relocatable inputs
ENSURE an executable image and deterministic placement report, or an error
execute Lua once and validate/copy its returned map
read each object and validate its structural references
assign every nonempty allocated section to an explicit placement rule
validate capacities, permissions, alignment, and initialized-prefix ordering
resolve global definitions and all required undefined references
apply checked relocations using final placements
verify the entry names a byte inside an executable contribution
sort loadable region indices by virtual address and emit program headers
write the completed image, set executable mode, and report placements

